{
    "title": "Claude by Anthropic",
    "description": "Get free access to the newly upgraded Claude 3.5 Sonnet \u2013 Anthropic\u2019s most intelligent model yet. Use Claude for work or for fun. Whether you're drafting a business proposal between meetings, translating menus while traveling, brainstorming gift ideas while shopping, or composing a speech while waiting for a flight, Claude is ready to assist you.\r\n\r\nINSTANT ANSWERS\r\n\r\nWith Claude you have a world of intelligence right in your pocket. Just start a chat, attach a file, or send Claude a photo for real-time image analysis\u2014and ask away.\r\n\r\nFASTER DEEP WORK\r\n\r\nCollaborate with Claude on critical tasks, brainstorming, and complex problems to make significant progress while you\u2019re on the go. Pick up and continue conversations with Claude across the web and other devices. \r\n\r\nLESS BUSY WORK\r\n\r\nClaude can help draft your emails, summarize your meetings, and assist with all the small tasks you don't want to do.\r\n\r\nINTELLIGENCE AT YOUR FINGERTIPS\r\n\r\nClaude is powered by the Claude 3 model family\u2014powerful AI models built by Anthropic\u2014giving you instant access to knowledge on every subject.\r\n\r\nTRUSTED PARTNER\r\n\r\nClaude is designed to be reliable, accurate, and helpful. It's brought to you by Anthropic, an AI research company dedicated to building safe and dependable AI tools.\r\n\r\nClaude is free to use. If you want 5x more Claude usage versus Free tier and access to additional models (Claude 3 Opus and Haiku), consider upgrading to our paid Pro plan.\r\n\r\nTerms of Service: https://www.anthropic.com/legal/consumer-terms\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.anthropic.com/legal/privacy",
